#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "A free IBM course on quantum information and computation"
msgstr "Kursus IBM percuma tentang maklumat dan pengiraan kuantum"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Analysis"
msgstr "Analisis"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Now we'll analyze Grover's algorithm to understand how it works.\n"
"We'll start with what could be described as a *symbolic* analysis, where we calculate how the Grover operation $G$ acts on certain states, and then we'll tie this symbolic analysis to a *geometric* picture that's helpful for visualizing how the algorithm works.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sekarang kita akan menganalisis algoritma Grover untuk memahami cara ia berfungsi.\n"
"Kita akan mulakan dengan apa yang boleh dihuraikan sebagai analisis *simbolik*, di mana kita mengira bagaimana operasi Grover $G$ bertindak ke atas keadaan-keadaan tertentu, kemudian kita akan menghubungkan analisis simbolik ini dengan gambaran *geometri* yang berguna untuk menvisualisasikan cara algoritma berfungsi.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Solutions and non-solutions {#solutions-and-non-solutions}"
msgstr "Penyelesaian dan bukan penyelesaian {#solutions-and-non-solutions}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Let's start by defining two sets of strings.\n"
msgstr "Mari kita mulakan dengan mentakrifkan dua set rentetan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"  A_0 &= \\bigl\\{ x\\in\\Sigma^n : f(x) = 0\\bigr\\} \\\\\n"
"  A_1 &= \\bigl\\{ x\\in\\Sigma^n : f(x) = 1\\bigr\\}\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"  A_0 &= \\bigl\\{ x\\in\\Sigma^n : f(x) = 0\\bigr\\} \\\\\n"
"  A_1 &= \\bigl\\{ x\\in\\Sigma^n : f(x) = 1\\bigr\\}\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The set $A_1$ contains all of the solutions to our search problem while $A_0$ contains the strings that aren't solutions (which we can refer to as *non-solutions* when it's convenient).\n"
"These two sets satisfy $A_0 \\cap A_1 = \\varnothing$ and $A_0 \\cup A_1 = \\Sigma^n$, which is to say that this is a *bipartition* of $\\Sigma^n$.\n"
msgstr ""
"Set $A_1$ mengandungi semua penyelesaian kepada masalah carian kita, manakala $A_0$ mengandungi rentetan yang bukan penyelesaian (yang boleh kita rujuk sebagai *bukan penyelesaian* apabila sesuai).\n"
"Kedua-dua set ini memenuhi $A_0 \\cap A_1 = \\varnothing$ dan $A_0 \\cup A_1 = \\Sigma^n$, yang bermakna ini adalah sebuah *bipartisi* daripada $\\Sigma^n$.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next we'll define two unit vectors representing uniform superpositions over the sets of solutions and non-solutions.\n"
msgstr "Seterusnya kita akan takrifkan dua vektor unit yang mewakili superposisi seragam ke atas set penyelesaian dan bukan penyelesaian.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"  \\vert A_0\\rangle &= \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\vert A_0\\vert}} \\sum_{x\\in A_0} \\vert x\\rangle \\\\\n"
"  \\vert A_1\\rangle &= \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\vert A_1\\vert}} \\sum_{x\\in A_1} \\vert x\\rangle\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"  \\vert A_0\\rangle &= \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\vert A_0\\vert}} \\sum_{x\\in A_0} \\vert x\\rangle \\\\\n"
"  \\vert A_1\\rangle &= \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\vert A_1\\vert}} \\sum_{x\\in A_1} \\vert x\\rangle\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Formally speaking, each of these vectors is only defined when its corresponding set is nonempty, but hereafter we're going to focus on the case that neither $A_0$ nor $A_1$ is empty.\n"
"The cases that $A_0 = \\varnothing$ and $A_1 = \\varnothing$ are easily handled separately, and we'll do that later.\n"
msgstr ""
"Secara formal, setiap vektor ini hanya ditakrifkan apabila set yang bersamaannya tidak kosong, tetapi mulai sekarang kita akan fokus pada kes di mana $A_0$ mahupun $A_1$ tidak kosong.\n"
"Kes $A_0 = \\varnothing$ dan $A_1 = \\varnothing$ mudah dikendalikan secara berasingan, dan kita akan lakukan itu kemudian.\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "As an aside, the notation being used here is common: any time we have a finite and nonempty set $S$, we can write $\\vert S\\rangle$ to denote the quantum state vector that's uniform over the elements of $S$.\n"
msgstr "Sebagai catatan tambahan, notasi yang digunakan di sini adalah lazim: setiap kali kita ada set $S$ yang terhingga dan tidak kosong, kita boleh tulis $\\vert S\\rangle$ untuk merujuk kepada vektor keadaan kuantum yang seragam ke atas unsur-unsur $S$.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Let's also define $\\vert u \\rangle$ to be a *uniform* quantum state over all $n$-bit strings:\n"
msgstr "Mari kita juga takrifkan $\\vert u \\rangle$ sebagai keadaan kuantum *seragam* ke atas semua rentetan $n$-bit:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert u\\rangle = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{N}} \\sum_{x\\in\\Sigma^n} \\vert x\\rangle.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert u\\rangle = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{N}} \\sum_{x\\in\\Sigma^n} \\vert x\\rangle.\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Notice that\n"
msgstr "Perhatikan bahawa\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert u\\rangle\n"
"= \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0 \\vert}{N}} \\vert A_0\\rangle\n"
"+ \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1 \\vert}{N}} \\vert A_1\\rangle.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert u\\rangle\n"
"= \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0 \\vert}{N}} \\vert A_0\\rangle\n"
"+ \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1 \\vert}{N}} \\vert A_1\\rangle.\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "We also have that $\\vert u\\rangle = H^{\\otimes n} \\vert 0^n \\rangle$, so $\\vert u\\rangle$ represents the state of the register $\\mathsf{Q}$ after the initialization in step 1 of Grover's algorithm.\n"
msgstr "Kita juga ada $\\vert u\\rangle = H^{\\otimes n} \\vert 0^n \\rangle$, jadi $\\vert u\\rangle$ mewakili keadaan daftar $\\mathsf{Q}$ selepas inisialisasi dalam langkah 1 algoritma Grover.\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This implies that just before the iterations of $G$ happen in step 2, the state of $\\mathsf{Q}$ is contained in the two-dimensional vector space spanned by $\\vert A_0\\rangle$ and $\\vert A_1\\rangle$, and moreover the coefficients of these vectors are real numbers.\n"
"As we will see, the state of $\\mathsf{Q}$ will always have these properties — meaning that the state is a real linear combination of $\\vert A_0\\rangle$ and $\\vert A_1\\rangle$ — after any number of iterations of the operation $G$ in step 2.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ini bermakna tepat sebelum iterasi $G$ berlaku dalam langkah 2, keadaan $\\mathsf{Q}$ terkandung dalam ruang vektor dua dimensi yang dijangkau oleh $\\vert A_0\\rangle$ dan $\\vert A_1\\rangle$, dan tambahan pula pekali vektor-vektor ini adalah nombor nyata.\n"
"Seperti yang akan kita lihat, keadaan $\\mathsf{Q}$ akan sentiasa mempunyai sifat-sifat ini — bermakna keadaan adalah gabungan linear nyata $\\vert A_0\\rangle$ dan $\\vert A_1\\rangle$ — selepas sebarang bilangan iterasi operasi $G$ dalam langkah 2.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "An observation about the Grover operation {#an-observation-about-the-grover-operation}"
msgstr "Pemerhatian tentang operasi Grover {#an-observation-about-the-grover-operation}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "We'll now turn our attention to the Grover operation\n"
msgstr "Sekarang kita akan menumpukan perhatian kepada operasi Grover\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"G = H^{\\otimes n} Z_{\\mathrm{OR}} H^{\\otimes n} Z_f,\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"G = H^{\\otimes n} Z_{\\mathrm{OR}} H^{\\otimes n} Z_f,\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "beginning with an interesting observation about it.\n"
msgstr "dimulakan dengan pemerhatian menarik mengenainya.\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Imagine for a moment that we replaced the function $f$ by the composition of $f$ with the NOT function — or, in other words, the function we get by flipping the output bit of $f$.\n"
"We'll call this new function $g$, and we can express it using symbols in a few alternative ways.\n"
msgstr ""
"Bayangkan sebentar kita menggantikan fungsi $f$ dengan komposisi $f$ dengan fungsi NOT — atau dengan kata lain, fungsi yang kita dapat dengan membalikkan bit output $f$.\n"
"Kita akan panggil fungsi baru ini $g$, dan kita boleh ungkapkannya menggunakan simbol dalam beberapa cara alternatif.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"g(x) = \\neg f(x) = 1 \\oplus f(x) = 1 - f(x) =\n"
"\\begin{cases}\n"
"1 & f(x) = 0\\\\[1mm]\n"
"0 & f(x) = 1\n"
"\\end{cases}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"g(x) = \\neg f(x) = 1 \\oplus f(x) = 1 - f(x) =\n"
"\\begin{cases}\n"
"1 & f(x) = 0\\\\[1mm]\n"
"0 & f(x) = 1\n"
"\\end{cases}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"(-1)^{g(x)} = (-1)^{1 \\oplus f(x)} = - (-1)^{f(x)}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"(-1)^{g(x)} = (-1)^{1 \\oplus f(x)} = - (-1)^{f(x)}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "for every string $x\\in\\Sigma^n$, and therefore\n"
msgstr "untuk setiap rentetan $x\\in\\Sigma^n$, dan oleh itu\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"Z_g = - Z_f.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"Z_g = - Z_f.\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This means that if we were to substitute the function $f$ with the function $g$, Grover's algorithm wouldn't function any differently — because the states we obtain from the algorithm in the two cases are necessarily equivalent up to a global phase.\n"
msgstr "Ini bermakna jika kita menggantikan fungsi $f$ dengan fungsi $g$, algoritma Grover tidak akan berfungsi secara berbeza — kerana keadaan yang kita dapat daripada algoritma dalam kedua-dua kes adalah semestinya setara sehingga satu fasa global.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This isn't a problem!\n"
"Intuitively speaking, the algorithm doesn't care which strings are solutions and which are non-solutions — it only needs to be able to *distinguish* solutions and non-solutions to operate correctly.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ini bukan masalah!\n"
"Secara intuitif, algoritma tidak mengambil berat yang mana rentetan adalah penyelesaian dan yang mana bukan — ia hanya perlu dapat *membezakan* penyelesaian dan bukan penyelesaian untuk berfungsi dengan betul.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Action of the Grover operation {#action-of-the-grover-operation}"
msgstr "Tindakan operasi Grover {#action-of-the-grover-operation}"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Now let's consider the action of $G$ on the quantum state vectors $\\vert A_0\\rangle$ and $\\vert A_1\\rangle$.\n"
msgstr "Sekarang mari kita pertimbangkan tindakan $G$ ke atas vektor keadaan kuantum $\\vert A_0\\rangle$ dan $\\vert A_1\\rangle$.\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "First, let's observe that the operation $Z_f$ has a very simple action on $\\vert A_0\\rangle$ and $\\vert A_1\\rangle$.\n"
msgstr "Pertama, mari kita perhatikan bahawa operasi $Z_f$ mempunyai tindakan yang sangat mudah ke atas $\\vert A_0\\rangle$ dan $\\vert A_1\\rangle$.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"Z_f \\vert A_0\\rangle & = \\vert A_0\\rangle \\\\[1mm]\n"
"Z_f \\vert A_1\\rangle & = -\\vert A_1\\rangle\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"Z_f \\vert A_0\\rangle & = \\vert A_0\\rangle \\\\[1mm]\n"
"Z_f \\vert A_1\\rangle & = -\\vert A_1\\rangle\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Second, we have the operation $H^{\\otimes n} Z_{\\mathrm{OR}} H^{\\otimes n}$.\n"
"The operation $Z_{\\mathrm{OR}}$ is defined as\n"
msgstr ""
"Kedua, kita ada operasi $H^{\\otimes n} Z_{\\mathrm{OR}} H^{\\otimes n}$.\n"
"Operasi $Z_{\\mathrm{OR}}$ ditakrifkan sebagai\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"Z_{\\mathrm{OR}} \\vert x\\rangle\n"
"= \\begin{cases}\n"
"\\vert x\\rangle & x = 0^n \\\\[2mm]\n"
"-\\vert x\\rangle & x \\neq 0^n,\n"
"\\end{cases}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"Z_{\\mathrm{OR}} \\vert x\\rangle\n"
"= \\begin{cases}\n"
"\\vert x\\rangle & x = 0^n \\\\[2mm]\n"
"-\\vert x\\rangle & x \\neq 0^n,\n"
"\\end{cases}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "again for every string $x\\in\\Sigma^n$, and a convenient alternative way to express this operation is like this:\n"
msgstr "sekali lagi untuk setiap rentetan $x\\in\\Sigma^n$, dan cara alternatif yang mudah untuk mengungkapkan operasi ini adalah seperti berikut:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"Z_{\\mathrm{OR}} = 2 \\vert 0^n \\rangle \\langle 0^n \\vert - \\mathbb{I}.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"Z_{\\mathrm{OR}} = 2 \\vert 0^n \\rangle \\langle 0^n \\vert - \\mathbb{I}.\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "A simple way to verify that this expression agrees with the definition of $Z_{\\mathrm{OR}}$ is to evaluate its action on standard basis states.\n"
msgstr "Cara mudah untuk mengesahkan bahawa ungkapan ini bersetuju dengan definisi $Z_{\\mathrm{OR}}$ adalah dengan menilai tindakannya ke atas keadaan asas piawai.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The operation $H^{\\otimes n} Z_{\\mathrm{OR}} H^{\\otimes n}$ can therefore be written like this:\n"
msgstr "Operasi $H^{\\otimes n} Z_{\\mathrm{OR}} H^{\\otimes n}$ oleh itu boleh ditulis seperti ini:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"H^{\\otimes n} Z_{\\mathrm{OR}} H^{\\otimes n} = 2 H^{\\otimes n} \\vert 0^n \\rangle \\langle 0^n \\vert H^{\\otimes n} - \\mathbb{I} = 2 \\vert u \\rangle \\langle u \\vert - \\mathbb{I},\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"H^{\\otimes n} Z_{\\mathrm{OR}} H^{\\otimes n} = 2 H^{\\otimes n} \\vert 0^n \\rangle \\langle 0^n \\vert H^{\\otimes n} - \\mathbb{I} = 2 \\vert u \\rangle \\langle u \\vert - \\mathbb{I},\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "using the same notation, $\\vert u \\rangle$, that we used above for the uniform superposition over all $n$-bit strings.\n"
msgstr "menggunakan notasi yang sama, $\\vert u \\rangle,$ yang kita gunakan di atas untuk superposisi seragam ke atas semua rentetan $n$-bit.\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"And now we have what we need to compute the action of $G$ on $\\vert A_0\\rangle$ and $\\vert A_1\\rangle$.\n"
"First let's compute the action of $G$ on $\\vert A_0\\rangle$.\n"
msgstr ""
"Dan kini kita ada apa yang diperlukan untuk mengira tindakan $G$ ke atas $\\vert A_0\\rangle$ dan $\\vert A_1\\rangle$.\n"
"Pertama mari kita kira tindakan $G$ ke atas $\\vert A_0\\rangle$.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"  G \\vert A_0 \\rangle\n"
"  & = \\bigl( 2 \\vert u\\rangle \\langle u \\vert - \\mathbb{I}\\bigr) Z_f \\vert A_0\\rangle \\\\\n"
"  & = \\bigl( 2 \\vert u\\rangle \\langle u \\vert - \\mathbb{I}\\bigr) \\vert A_0\\rangle \\\\\n"
"  & = 2 \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert}{N}} \\vert u\\rangle -\\vert A_0 \\rangle\\\\\n"
"  & = 2 \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert}{N}} \\biggl(\n"
"  \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert}{N}} \\vert A_0\\rangle + \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1\\vert}{N}} \\vert A_1\\rangle\\biggr)\n"
"  -\\vert A_0 \\rangle \\\\\n"
"  & = \\biggl( \\frac{2\\vert A_0\\vert}{N} - 1\\biggr) \\vert A_0 \\rangle\n"
"  + \\frac{2 \\sqrt{\\vert A_0\\vert \\cdot \\vert A_1\\vert}}{N} \\vert A_1 \\rangle \\\\\n"
"  & = \\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert - \\vert A_1\\vert}{N} \\vert A_0 \\rangle\n"
"  + \\frac{2 \\sqrt{\\vert A_0\\vert \\cdot \\vert A_1\\vert}}{N} \\vert A_1 \\rangle\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"  G \\vert A_0 \\rangle\n"
"  & = \\bigl( 2 \\vert u\\rangle \\langle u \\vert - \\mathbb{I}\\bigr) Z_f \\vert A_0\\rangle \\\\\n"
"  & = \\bigl( 2 \\vert u\\rangle \\langle u \\vert - \\mathbb{I}\\bigr) \\vert A_0\\rangle \\\\\n"
"  & = 2 \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert}{N}} \\vert u\\rangle -\\vert A_0 \\rangle\\\\\n"
"  & = 2 \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert}{N}} \\biggl(\n"
"  \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert}{N}} \\vert A_0\\rangle + \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1\\vert}{N}} \\vert A_1\\rangle\\biggr)\n"
"  -\\vert A_0 \\rangle \\\\\n"
"  & = \\biggl( \\frac{2\\vert A_0\\vert}{N} - 1\\biggr) \\vert A_0 \\rangle\n"
"  + \\frac{2 \\sqrt{\\vert A_0\\vert \\cdot \\vert A_1\\vert}}{N} \\vert A_1 \\rangle \\\\\n"
"  & = \\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert - \\vert A_1\\vert}{N} \\vert A_0 \\rangle\n"
"  + \\frac{2 \\sqrt{\\vert A_0\\vert \\cdot \\vert A_1\\vert}}{N} \\vert A_1 \\rangle\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "And second, let's compute the action of $G$ on $\\vert A_1\\rangle$.\n"
msgstr "Dan kedua, mari kita kira tindakan $G$ ke atas $\\vert A_1\\rangle$.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"  G \\vert A_1 \\rangle\n"
"  & = \\bigl( 2 \\vert u\\rangle \\langle u \\vert - \\mathbb{I} \\bigr) Z_f \\vert A_1\\rangle \\\\\n"
"  & = - \\bigl( 2 \\vert u\\rangle \\langle u \\vert - \\mathbb{I} \\bigr) \\vert A_1\\rangle \\\\\n"
"  & = - 2 \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1\\vert}{N}} \\vert u\\rangle + \\vert A_1 \\rangle \\\\\n"
"  & = - 2 \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1\\vert}{N}} \\biggl(\\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert}{N}} \\vert A_0\\rangle\n"
"      + \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1\\vert}{N}} \\vert A_1\\rangle\\biggr) + \\vert A_1 \\rangle \\\\\n"
"  & = - \\frac{2 \\sqrt{\\vert A_1\\vert \\cdot \\vert A_0\\vert}}{N} \\vert A_0 \\rangle\n"
"      + \\biggl( 1 - \\frac{2\\vert A_1\\vert}{N} \\biggr) \\vert A_1 \\rangle \\\\\n"
"  & = - \\frac{2 \\sqrt{\\vert A_1\\vert \\cdot \\vert A_0\\vert}}{N} \\vert A_0 \\rangle\n"
"      + \\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert - \\vert A_1\\vert}{N} \\vert A_1 \\rangle\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"  G \\vert A_1 \\rangle\n"
"  & = \\bigl( 2 \\vert u\\rangle \\langle u \\vert - \\mathbb{I} \\bigr) Z_f \\vert A_1\\rangle \\\\\n"
"  & = - \\bigl( 2 \\vert u\\rangle \\langle u \\vert - \\mathbb{I} \\bigr) \\vert A_1\\rangle \\\\\n"
"  & = - 2 \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1\\vert}{N}} \\vert u\\rangle + \\vert A_1 \\rangle \\\\\n"
"  & = - 2 \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1\\vert}{N}} \\biggl(\\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert}{N}} \\vert A_0\\rangle\n"
"      + \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1\\vert}{N}} \\vert A_1\\rangle\\biggr) + \\vert A_1 \\rangle \\\\\n"
"  & = - \\frac{2 \\sqrt{\\vert A_1\\vert \\cdot \\vert A_0\\vert}}{N} \\vert A_0 \\rangle\n"
"      + \\biggl( 1 - \\frac{2\\vert A_1\\vert}{N} \\biggr) \\vert A_1 \\rangle \\\\\n"
"  & = - \\frac{2 \\sqrt{\\vert A_1\\vert \\cdot \\vert A_0\\vert}}{N} \\vert A_0 \\rangle\n"
"      + \\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert - \\vert A_1\\vert}{N} \\vert A_1 \\rangle\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "In both cases we're using the equation\n"
msgstr "Dalam kedua-dua kes kita menggunakan persamaan\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert u\\rangle\n"
"= \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0 \\vert}{N}} \\vert A_0\\rangle\n"
"+ \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1 \\vert}{N}} \\vert A_1\\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert u\\rangle\n"
"= \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0 \\vert}{N}} \\vert A_0\\rangle\n"
"+ \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1 \\vert}{N}} \\vert A_1\\rangle\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "along with the expressions\n"
msgstr "bersama dengan ungkapan\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\langle u \\vert A_0\\rangle = \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0 \\vert}{N}}\n"
"\\qquad\\text{and}\\qquad\n"
"\\langle u \\vert A_1\\rangle = \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1 \\vert}{N}}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\langle u \\vert A_0\\rangle = \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0 \\vert}{N}}\n"
"\\qquad\\text{dan}\\qquad\n"
"\\langle u \\vert A_1\\rangle = \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1 \\vert}{N}}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "that follow.\n"
msgstr "yang mengikutinya.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "In summary, we have\n"
msgstr "Secara ringkasnya, kita ada\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"  G \\vert A_0 \\rangle\n"
"  & = \\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert - \\vert A_1\\vert}{N} \\vert A_0 \\rangle\n"
"  + \\frac{2 \\sqrt{\\vert A_0\\vert \\cdot \\vert A_1\\vert}}{N} \\vert A_1 \\rangle\\\\[2mm]\n"
"  G \\vert A_1 \\rangle\n"
"  & = - \\frac{2 \\sqrt{\\vert A_1\\vert \\cdot \\vert A_0\\vert}}{N} \\vert A_0 \\rangle\n"
"      + \\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert - \\vert A_1\\vert}{N} \\vert A_1 \\rangle.\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"  G \\vert A_0 \\rangle\n"
"  & = \\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert - \\vert A_1\\vert}{N} \\vert A_0 \\rangle\n"
"  + \\frac{2 \\sqrt{\\vert A_0\\vert \\cdot \\vert A_1\\vert}}{N} \\vert A_1 \\rangle\\\\[2mm]\n"
"  G \\vert A_1 \\rangle\n"
"  & = - \\frac{2 \\sqrt{\\vert A_1\\vert \\cdot \\vert A_0\\vert}}{N} \\vert A_0 \\rangle\n"
"      + \\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert - \\vert A_1\\vert}{N} \\vert A_1 \\rangle.\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"As we already noted, the state of $\\mathsf{Q}$ just prior to step 2 is contained in the two-dimensional space spanned by $\\vert A_0\\rangle$ and $\\vert A_1\\rangle$, and we have just established that $G$ maps any vector in this space to another vector in the same space.\n"
"This means that, for the sake of the analysis, we can focus our attention exclusively on this subspace.\n"
msgstr ""
"Seperti yang telah kita perhatikan, keadaan $\\mathsf{Q}$ tepat sebelum langkah 2 terkandung dalam ruang dua dimensi yang dijangkau oleh $\\vert A_0\\rangle$ dan $\\vert A_1\\rangle$, dan kita baru sahaja menetapkan bahawa $G$ memetakan sebarang vektor dalam ruang ini ke vektor lain dalam ruang yang sama.\n"
"Ini bermakna, untuk tujuan analisis, kita boleh menumpukan perhatian kita secara eksklusif pada subruang ini.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To better understand what's happening within this two-dimensional space, let's express the action of $G$ on this space as a matrix,\n"
msgstr "Untuk lebih memahami apa yang berlaku dalam ruang dua dimensi ini, mari kita ungkapkan tindakan $G$ pada ruang ini sebagai matriks,\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"M = \\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"  \\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert - \\vert A_1\\vert}{N} & -\\frac{2 \\sqrt{\\vert A_1\\vert \\cdot \\vert A_0\\vert}}{N} \\\\[2mm]\n"
"  \\frac{2 \\sqrt{\\vert A_0\\vert \\cdot \\vert A_1\\vert}}{N} & \\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert - \\vert A_1\\vert}{N}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix},\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"M = \\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"  \\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert - \\vert A_1\\vert}{N} & -\\frac{2 \\sqrt{\\vert A_1\\vert \\cdot \\vert A_0\\vert}}{N} \\\\[2mm]\n"
"  \\frac{2 \\sqrt{\\vert A_0\\vert \\cdot \\vert A_1\\vert}}{N} & \\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert - \\vert A_1\\vert}{N}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix},\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"whose first and second rows/columns correspond to $\\vert A_0\\rangle$ and $\\vert A_1\\rangle$, respectively.\n"
"So far in this series, we've always connected the rows and columns of matrices with the classical states of a system, but matrices can also be used to describe the actions of linear mappings on different bases like we have here.\n"
msgstr ""
"di mana baris/lajur pertama dan kedua berkaitan dengan $\\vert A_0\\rangle$ dan $\\vert A_1\\rangle$, masing-masing.\n"
"Setakat ini dalam siri ini, kita sentiasa menghubungkan baris dan lajur matriks dengan keadaan klasik sesebuah sistem, tetapi matriks juga boleh digunakan untuk menerangkan tindakan pemetaan linear ke atas asas yang berbeza seperti yang kita ada di sini.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "While it isn't at all obvious at first glance, the matrix $M$ is what we obtain by *squaring* a simpler-looking matrix.\n"
msgstr "Walaupun tidak jelas sama sekali pada pandangan pertama, matriks $M$ adalah apa yang kita peroleh dengan *mengkuasakan dua* matriks yang kelihatan lebih mudah.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"  \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert}{N}} & - \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1\\vert}{N}} \\\\[2mm]\n"
"  \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1\\vert}{N}} & \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert}{N}}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}^2\n"
"=\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"  \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert}{N}} & - \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1\\vert}{N}} \\\\[2mm]\n"
"  \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1\\vert}{N}} & \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert}{N}}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}^2\n"
"=\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"  \\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert - \\vert A_1\\vert}{N} & -\\frac{2 \\sqrt{\\vert A_1\\vert \\cdot \\vert A_0\\vert}}{N} \\\\[2mm]\n"
"  \\frac{2 \\sqrt{\\vert A_0\\vert \\cdot \\vert A_1\\vert}}{N} & \\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert - \\vert A_1\\vert}{N}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix} = M\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"  \\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert - \\vert A_1\\vert}{N} & -\\frac{2 \\sqrt{\\vert A_1\\vert \\cdot \\vert A_0\\vert}}{N} \\\\[2mm]\n"
"  \\frac{2 \\sqrt{\\vert A_0\\vert \\cdot \\vert A_1\\vert}}{N} & \\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert - \\vert A_1\\vert}{N}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix} = M\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The matrix\n"
msgstr "Matriks\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"  \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert}{N}} & - \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1\\vert}{N}} \\\\[2mm]\n"
"  \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1\\vert}{N}} & \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert}{N}}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"  \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert}{N}} & - \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1\\vert}{N}} \\\\[2mm]\n"
"  \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1\\vert}{N}} & \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert}{N}}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "is a *rotation matrix*, which we can alternatively express as\n"
msgstr "adalah sebuah *matriks putaran*, yang boleh kita ungkapkan secara alternatif sebagai\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"  \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert}{N}} & - \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1\\vert}{N}} \\\\[2mm]\n"
"  \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1\\vert}{N}} & \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert}{N}}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"=\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"  \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert}{N}} & - \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1\\vert}{N}} \\\\[2mm]\n"
"  \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1\\vert}{N}} & \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert}{N}}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"=\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"  \\cos(\\theta) & -\\sin(\\theta) \\\\[2mm]\n"
"  \\sin(\\theta) & \\cos(\\theta)\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"  \\cos(\\theta) & -\\sin(\\theta) \\\\[2mm]\n"
"  \\sin(\\theta) & \\cos(\\theta)\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "for\n"
msgstr "untuk\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\theta = \\sin^{-1}\\biggl(\\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1\\vert}{N}}\\biggr).\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\theta = \\sin^{-1}\\biggl(\\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1\\vert}{N}}\\biggr).\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This angle $\\theta$ is going to play a very important role in the analysis that follows, so it's worth stressing its importance here as we see it for the first time.\n"
msgstr "Sudut $\\theta$ ini akan memainkan peranan yang sangat penting dalam analisis yang berikut, jadi penting untuk menekankan kepentingannya di sini ketika kita melihatnya buat kali pertama.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "In light of this expression of this matrix, we observe that\n"
msgstr "Dengan mengambil kira ungkapan matriks ini, kita perhatikan bahawa\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"M = \\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"  \\cos(\\theta) & -\\sin(\\theta) \\\\[2mm]\n"
"  \\sin(\\theta) & \\cos(\\theta)\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}^2\n"
"= \\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"  \\cos(2\\theta) & -\\sin(2\\theta) \\\\[2mm]\n"
"  \\sin(2\\theta) & \\cos(2\\theta)\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"M = \\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"  \\cos(\\theta) & -\\sin(\\theta) \\\\[2mm]\n"
"  \\sin(\\theta) & \\cos(\\theta)\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}^2\n"
"= \\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"  \\cos(2\\theta) & -\\sin(2\\theta) \\\\[2mm]\n"
"  \\sin(2\\theta) & \\cos(2\\theta)\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}.\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This is because rotating by the angle $\\theta$ two times is equivalent to rotating by the angle $2\\theta$.\n"
"Another way to see this is to make use of the alternative expression\n"
msgstr ""
"Ini kerana memutar sebanyak sudut $\\theta$ dua kali adalah setara dengan memutar sebanyak sudut $2\\theta$.\n"
"Cara lain untuk melihat ini ialah dengan menggunakan ungkapan alternatif\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\theta\n"
"= \\cos^{-1}\\biggl(\\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert}{N}}\\biggr),\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\theta\n"
"= \\cos^{-1}\\biggl(\\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert}{N}}\\biggr),\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "together with the *double angle* formulas from trigonometry:\n"
msgstr "bersama-sama dengan formula *sudut berganda* daripada trigonometri:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\cos(2\\theta) & = \\cos^2(\\theta) - \\sin^2(\\theta)\\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\sin(2\\theta) & = 2 \\sin(\\theta)\\cos(\\theta).\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"
"In summary, the state of the register $\\mathsf{Q}$ at the start of step 2 is\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\cos(2\\theta) & = \\cos^2(\\theta) - \\sin^2(\\theta)\\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\sin(2\\theta) & = 2 \\sin(\\theta)\\cos(\\theta).\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"
"Secara ringkasnya, keadaan daftar $\\mathsf{Q}$ pada permulaan langkah 2 adalah\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert u\\rangle\n"
"= \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert}{N}} \\vert A_0\\rangle\n"
"+ \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1\\vert}{N}} \\vert A_1\\rangle\n"
"= \\cos(\\theta) \\vert A_0\\rangle + \\sin(\\theta) \\vert A_1\\rangle,\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert u\\rangle\n"
"= \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert}{N}} \\vert A_0\\rangle\n"
"+ \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1\\vert}{N}} \\vert A_1\\rangle\n"
"= \\cos(\\theta) \\vert A_0\\rangle + \\sin(\\theta) \\vert A_1\\rangle,\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"and the effect of applying $G$ to this state is to rotate it by an angle $2\\theta$ within the space spanned by $\\vert A_0\\rangle$ and $\\vert A_1\\rangle$.\n"
"So, for example, we have\n"
msgstr ""
"dan kesan menggunakan $G$ ke atas keadaan ini adalah untuk memutarkannya sebanyak sudut $2\\theta$ dalam ruang yang dijangkau oleh $\\vert A_0\\rangle$ dan $\\vert A_1\\rangle$.\n"
"Jadi, sebagai contoh, kita ada\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"G \\vert u \\rangle &= \\cos(3\\theta) \\vert A_0\\rangle + \\sin(3\\theta) \\vert A_1\\rangle\\\\[1mm]\n"
"G^2 \\vert u \\rangle &= \\cos(5\\theta) \\vert A_0\\rangle + \\sin(5\\theta) \\vert A_1\\rangle\\\\[1mm]\n"
"G^3 \\vert u \\rangle &= \\cos(7\\theta) \\vert A_0\\rangle + \\sin(7\\theta) \\vert A_1\\rangle\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"G \\vert u \\rangle &= \\cos(3\\theta) \\vert A_0\\rangle + \\sin(3\\theta) \\vert A_1\\rangle\\\\[1mm]\n"
"G^2 \\vert u \\rangle &= \\cos(5\\theta) \\vert A_0\\rangle + \\sin(5\\theta) \\vert A_1\\rangle\\\\[1mm]\n"
"G^3 \\vert u \\rangle &= \\cos(7\\theta) \\vert A_0\\rangle + \\sin(7\\theta) \\vert A_1\\rangle\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "and in general\n"
msgstr "dan secara umumnya\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"G^t \\vert u \\rangle\n"
"= \\cos\\bigl((2t + 1)\\theta\\bigr) \\vert A_0\\rangle\n"
"+ \\sin\\bigl((2t + 1)\\theta\\bigr) \\vert A_1\\rangle.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"G^t \\vert u \\rangle\n"
"= \\cos\\bigl((2t + 1)\\theta\\bigr) \\vert A_0\\rangle\n"
"+ \\sin\\bigl((2t + 1)\\theta\\bigr) \\vert A_1\\rangle.\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Geometric picture {#geometric-picture}"
msgstr "Gambaran geometri {#geometric-picture}"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Now let's connect the analysis we just went through to a geometric picture.\n"
"The idea is that the operation $G$ is the product of two *reflections*,\n"
"$Z_f$ and $H^{\\otimes n} Z_{\\mathrm{OR}} H^{\\otimes n}$.\n"
"And the net effect of performing two reflections is to perform a *rotation*.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sekarang mari kita hubungkan analisis yang baru kita lalui dengan gambaran geometri.\n"
"Ideanya ialah operasi $G$ adalah hasil darab dua *pantulan*,\n"
"$Z_f$ dan $H^{\\otimes n} Z_{\\mathrm{OR}} H^{\\otimes n}.$\n"
"Dan kesan bersih daripada melakukan dua pantulan adalah melakukan sebuah *putaran*.\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Let's start with $Z_f$.\n"
"As we already observed previously, we have\n"
msgstr ""
"Mari kita mulakan dengan $Z_f$.\n"
"Seperti yang telah kita perhatikan sebelum ini, kita ada\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"Z_f \\vert A_0\\rangle & = \\vert A_0\\rangle \\\\[1mm]\n"
"Z_f \\vert A_1\\rangle & = -\\vert A_1\\rangle.\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"Z_f \\vert A_0\\rangle & = \\vert A_0\\rangle \\\\[1mm]\n"
"Z_f \\vert A_1\\rangle & = -\\vert A_1\\rangle.\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Within the two-dimensional vector space spanned by $\\vert A_0\\rangle$ and $\\vert A_1\\rangle$,\n"
"this is a *reflection* about the line parallel to $\\vert A_0\\rangle$, which we'll call $L_1$.\n"
"Here's a figure illustrating the action of this reflection on a hypothetical unit vector $\\vert\\psi\\rangle$,\n"
"which we're assuming is a real linear combination of $\\vert A_0\\rangle$ and $\\vert A_1\\rangle$.\n"
msgstr ""
"Dalam ruang vektor dua dimensi yang dijangkau oleh $\\vert A_0\\rangle$ dan $\\vert A_1\\rangle$,\n"
"ini adalah sebuah *pantulan* tentang garis yang selari dengan $\\vert A_0\\rangle$, yang akan kita panggil $L_1$.\n"
"Berikut adalah rajah yang menggambarkan tindakan pantulan ini ke atas vektor unit hipotetikal $\\vert\\psi\\rangle$,\n"
"yang kita anggap adalah gabungan linear nyata $\\vert A_0\\rangle$ dan $\\vert A_1\\rangle$.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![A figure depicting the action of a reflection on a vector.](/learning/images/courses/fundamentals-of-quantum-algorithms/grover-algorithm/reflection1.svg)\n"
msgstr "![A figure depicting the action of a reflection on a vector.](/learning/images/courses/fundamentals-of-quantum-algorithms/grover-algorithm/reflection1.svg)\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Second we have the operation $H^{\\otimes n} Z_{\\mathrm{OR}} H^{\\otimes n}$, which we've already seen can be written as\n"
msgstr "Kedua kita ada operasi $H^{\\otimes n} Z_{\\mathrm{OR}} H^{\\otimes n}$, yang telah kita lihat boleh ditulis sebagai\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"H^{\\otimes n} Z_{\\mathrm{OR}} H^{\\otimes n} = 2 \\vert u \\rangle \\langle u \\vert - \\mathbb{I}.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"H^{\\otimes n} Z_{\\mathrm{OR}} H^{\\otimes n} = 2 \\vert u \\rangle \\langle u \\vert - \\mathbb{I}.\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This is also a reflection, this time about the line $L_2$ parallel to the vector $\\vert u\\rangle$.\n"
"Here's a figure depicting the action of this reflection on a unit vector $\\vert\\psi\\rangle$.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ini juga satu pantulan, kali ini tentang garis $L_2$ yang selari dengan vektor $\\vert u\\rangle$.\n"
"Berikut adalah rajah yang menggambarkan tindakan pantulan ini ke atas vektor unit $\\vert\\psi\\rangle$.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![A figure depicting the action of a second reflection on a vector.](/learning/images/courses/fundamentals-of-quantum-algorithms/grover-algorithm/reflection2.svg)\n"
msgstr "![A figure depicting the action of a second reflection on a vector.](/learning/images/courses/fundamentals-of-quantum-algorithms/grover-algorithm/reflection2.svg)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "When we compose these two reflections, we obtain a rotation — by twice the angle between the lines of reflection — as this figure illustrates.\n"
msgstr "Apabila kita menggabungkan dua pantulan ini, kita memperoleh satu putaran — sebanyak dua kali sudut di antara garis-garis pantulan — seperti yang digambarkan dalam rajah ini.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![A figure depicting the action of the Grover operation on a vector.](/learning/images/courses/fundamentals-of-quantum-algorithms/grover-algorithm/Grover_rotation.svg)\n"
msgstr "![A figure depicting the action of the Grover operation on a vector.](/learning/images/courses/fundamentals-of-quantum-algorithms/grover-algorithm/Grover_rotation.svg)\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This explains, in geometric terms, why the effect of the Grover operation is to rotate linear combinations of $\\vert A_0\\rangle$ and $\\vert A_1\\rangle$ by an angle of $2\\theta$.\n"
msgstr "Ini menjelaskan, dari segi geometri, mengapa kesan operasi Grover adalah untuk memutar gabungan linear $\\vert A_0\\rangle$ dan $\\vert A_1\\rangle$ sebanyak sudut $2\\theta$.\n"
